    <description>When a Subscription New or Subscription Renewal Opportunity is created, creates its Beacon Feedback survey records. Subscription New gets Sales Demo and Sales Prospecting surveys. Subscription Renewal gets Onboarding Call 1 - Kick Off and Customer Call surveys, due 15 and 45 days after the Close Date. Each survey is owned by the Opportunity Owner and linked to the Opportunity. A survey is only built if its Beacon Feedback record type is found. Only runs when Run Flows is checked on the On/Off Switch custom setting.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Due Date for the Customer Call survey: the Opportunity Close Date plus 45 days.</description>
        <name>formCustomerCallDueDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.CloseDate} + {!conCustomerCallDueDateDays}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Due Date for the Onboarding Call 1 - Kick Off survey: the Opportunity Close Date plus 15 days.</description>
        <name>formOnboardingCall1DueDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.CloseDate} + {!conOnboardingCall1DueDateDays}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Opportunity - On Create - After Save {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Opportunity - On Create - After Save</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
